+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Ordered collections
+//
+// Some collections exist to be a SEQUENCE — the sections of a campaign page, the
+// slides of a hero, the tiers of a sponsor wall. Their entries carry a numeric
+// `order`, and until now the only way to rearrange one was to open each entry
